<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices steady-higher, ammonia up sharply.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices steady-higher, ammonia up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were steady to lower and ammonia prices were sharply higher due to disruptions in world supply and gradually increasing demand, several dealers said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182		    unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     184-186		   dn 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   220-225		   up 20</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
